Hi,

I've uploaded the results of a bulk rebuild for NetBSD/alpha
4.0_BETA2 to

   ftp://ftp.NetBSD.org/pub/pkgsrc/packages-2007Q1/NetBSD-4.0/alpha/

A total of 2.1GB of packages were uploaded, and in total 533 packages
are available in new versions or were not present before.

The source tree this was built from was updated May 18.

As indicated above, the build was done on a machine running
NetBSD 4.0_BETA2, so these packages are not compatible with
installations using packages from before we switched to gcc 4.

I will re-update my source tree and start a new bulk build to
pick up new changes on the pkgsrc-2007Q1 branch.

Regards,

